{"job_id":"F-c36673291aab469b5d4c","family_id":"F-c36673291aab469b5d4c","title":"통일ㆍ북한 연구비 지급 규정","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011982-279321-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":15,"target_id":"47812810fb916a7af409915c15a922d9217f892e80bfeedb08945977ac3d9f5e","source_hash":"72200e49fa200284c9e239783909e210a4f7409caf9723f1e11af420cf00b019","text":"关于支付统一和朝鲜研究经费的规定"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011982-279321-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":178,"target_id":"fd8c548c0201ca12b89f82c07fe96d251ce1f778b49d37077e9d97afe920975c","source_hash":"a85fafd5bb74e1928db7a3cd9fc2246e09744d019dcc241ccd3d791ce4d6e22d","text":"第一条（目的）本法令旨在规定有关统一和朝鲜问题研究经费的支付事宜，以鼓励民主和平统一教育院教职人员开展统一和朝鲜问题研究，从而增强其研究能力，并为统一政策和对朝政策的制定作出贡献。<2021年3月30日修订；2025年11月4日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011982-279321-ko","scope":"BODY","start":178,"end":287,"target_id":"f6d17227994b248b5c3f2809e6e79ca9ac401700eb3ed6370980140b6d6773b5","source_hash":"85d23d09b6d3deafb27dc87d09682d64f9a08ef541ae7044989a38220f86deab","text":"第二条（适用范围）本法令适用于依据《公务员人力资源开发法》第五条第一款设立的国立民主和平统一教育研究所的教职人员。<2016年2月3日、2021年3月30日、2025年11月4日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011982-279321-ko","scope":"BODY","start":287,"end":307,"target_id":"20bb2984bccf27375a7c532354509bd811575d246d06d12729711404407c375c","source_hash":"1416497979f6e26ad97142756f8c13b9be1b8568b459123985b326f06c14a87f","text":"删除条款 3 <2014.5.21>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011982-279321-ko","scope":"BODY","start":307,"end":592,"target_id":"7fde92f742d762f76227d8bcef219ac06fb80d7ebf238dc975c2eb0b6311d3da","source_hash":"ae905ba1b7f69ea02c65706dbb0d03b000dcbceeaab216c3f8e8c2b66df4911d","text":"第四条（研究计划的提交与审批）  拟申请有关统一和朝鲜问题的研究经费（以下简称“研究经费”）的申请人，应当按照国家民主和平统一教育院院长制定的规定，向国家民主和平统一教育院院长提交研究计划（以下简称“研究计划”），并取得批准。研究计划应包含下列各款所述内容。如需修改已获批准的研究计划，亦应遵循上述规定。<2021年3月30日修订；2025年11月4日修订>\n1. 研究标题\n2. 研究目标和必要性\n3. 研究内容与方法\n4. 研究周期和时间表\n5. 研究成果的预期效果和利用计划\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011982-279321-ko","scope":"BODY","start":592,"end":863,"target_id":"8e7fb9e57510dfb98589ccc1b52d5d9af994c03c87b7a10ce997d110ac28d683","source_hash":"e248705172189ef81a2ce1852cac7c1c70c6b954f71681f5e4d470240b369ecc","text":"第五条（研究人员的职责）\n① 根据第四条获得研究计划授权的人员（以下简称“研究人员”）应当按照国家民主和平统一教育研究所所长批准的研究计划开展研究，并至少在研究期间提交一次研究进展中期报告。<2021年3月30日修订；2025年11月4日修订>\n② 研究人员应按照国立民主和平统一教育研究所所长批准的研究计划，在研究期结束后一个月内向所长提交最终报告。<2021年3月30日修订；2025年11月4日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011982-279321-ko","scope":"BODY","start":863,"end":997,"target_id":"bbc0aeb5756c8aab13fd34a2e74a1c1c4c9d2b81aa8261c2b83079482b1f251e","source_hash":"7527897d43a7ba14e12455e05369b8c99b93f699ed348559d8b11b3d5353e108","text":"第六条（研究经费的支付）  国家民主和平统一教育研究所所长在收到根据第五条第二款提交的最终报告后，应当进行评估，并根据评估结果，在预算范围内，对每个研究项目进行差异化的研究经费支付。<2014年5月21日、2021年3月30日、2025年11月4日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011982-279321-ko","scope":"BODY","start":997,"end":1099,"target_id":"a6581c8517e133899a90e8d991fafd8d44bcb1c1c44bd1a543dfc7174a2afc9b","source_hash":"eab978752b344acf6dd87b8696e5cd988652a79b8766748dc3968d486583f5b5","text":"第七条（报告）国家民主和平统一教育研究所所长应当于每年1月31日前向统一部长报告上一年度的最终报告和研究经费支出情况。<2021年3月30日修订；2025年11月4日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011982-279321-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1099,"end":1268,"target_id":"330597e4b29341c32010770ae2e52cf099aaf03d80b7cc183349554733d670c3","source_hash":"f04a4884f889df216e6fc9493aeafddabbc7169cc863656b76c10bf20726fa85","text":"第八条（科研经费的追回和支付限制）\n① 国家民主和平统一教育研究所所长应当追回研究人员通过虚假或其他欺诈手段获得的科研经费。<2014年5月21日、2021年3月30日、2025年11月4日修订>\n② 根据第 1 款规定，已收回研究经费的研究人员，一年内不得再获得研究经费。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011982-279321-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1268,"end":1291,"target_id":"22c93220e0b267e41b264adb3793584990e7e9d7ec7421cc5ecc65d804415267","source_hash":"54539ffec988025f7e4232dc49d565fa84d705a74d6904eedcecfe10a46e8df8","text":"补充规定 <第25063号，2014年1月7日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011982-279321-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1291,"end":1320,"target_id":"d5957a8bcc8a348b6b0af0b2d734c04cd36841b12dd68e51dcab3cc7c6ba8e90","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011982-279321-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1320,"end":1427,"target_id":"1b36066073831af0b18818833bcc374c9a1048bc0ab50398a271512ef58dc031","source_hash":"2d84e34e4f3ef6686bca9266e3b7999986b167044b14dd555906c5fc1cb39013","text":"第二条（关于研究计划审批等的过渡措施）  在本法令生效前，经统一教育研究所所长批准研究计划并完成研究后提交的最终报告，应视为按照本法令规定程序提交的最终报告。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011982-279321-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1427,"end":1516,"target_id":"8511e23f06745e05e13c904eb051cbad90cc996418a0308b838507f39266ecab","source_hash":"cd45830ea037cece9ccb1f7e023d2cbb931dd816f8f03082d8e4ab84dec10803","text":"增补（关于重组行政机关下属委员会等的《国家综合交通系统效率法》等实施细则的部分修正）<2014年5月21日，第25354号>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011982-279321-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1516,"end":1554,"target_id":"90e5b2429877633c1b01dcc995278b138cafb2cf4090d930a215db217dc750fd","source_hash":"22d8935b97e3d26f3040ca78dfae9f64fbe8d0d32505c28a357e10664749e86a","text":"补充规定（公务员人力资源开发法实施令）<第26944号，2016年2月3日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011982-279321-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1554,"end":1583,"target_id":"8df0bfa6ce2d568cf61ad9e63097ddf73107f1a330631f72d2dbabfd54f78075","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011982-279321-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1583,"end":1591,"target_id":"40afef9a0e5e9def1a946894e954a0c1bf7942b092c1d1445475b5670207f149","source_hash":"1fa2d78222cc5f3a7b268ba3015a524a8e57a9355a8b17e0ae4253566ef34323","text":"第 2 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011982-279321-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1591,"end":1662,"target_id":"fd8bfed9c13cf2a57df953f79f1deeb38dbbd9b2e87833870ea9b5cb669189ee","source_hash":"e4bdafa2bdb09bbd010913a0417fa1fd20d039c0b6c64f81f95cedf02e85f20b","text":"第三条（修改其他法律）①至<19>款省略\n\n  <20> 《统一与朝鲜研究经费支付条例》部分修订如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011982-279321-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1662,"end":1726,"target_id":"2b30204ff15d2173a9caf11e7e26fcbd23017dd05ac8571c62f6672e73975bf6","source_hash":"55ca733bc232b239fbde1e7fd07fcc5397d248c41dc99ad3671b7c0cb6979de0","text":"  第二条中的“《公务员教育培训法》”应改为“《公务员人力资源开发法》”。\n\n  <21> 至 <23> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011982-279321-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1726,"end":1734,"target_id":"19bdb40e0631292ef35affba368be272a79a40f10ad71ce2aba6559584e80bb8","source_hash":"bc28291f8a8368cab289540ec155c57b21b6d38387b73664ba08b936ee269006","text":"第 4 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011982-279321-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1734,"end":1774,"target_id":"401c1e5100e995f591075032de672e27df0b41ed49234111b76651aaab2dfb82","source_hash":"5a79b029e6a5e67369257a0600d27af1d344b5f24441e5e55036ec02e0ea7447","text":"增编（统一部及其下属机构组织结构）<2021年3月30日，第31559号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011982-279321-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1774,"end":1803,"target_id":"c2dc5eba4ea458cc4a552dd8fbe241deb5f3a33cc6773dc38d495fd3c02cd57f","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011982-279321-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1803,"end":1868,"target_id":"3cb114e6494b5a0dd48558cba6c4111aa4b49c6cf97116ef4e5fefce1e41f711","source_hash":"b1adfb04369808bcec5e75b76c1cc33f40d061fa9dea0376eeca5913fcb783d2","text":"第二条（修改其他法律）①至③ 省略\n\n  ④ 《统一与朝鲜研究经费支付条例》部分修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00023","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011982-279321-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1868,"end":1911,"target_id":"45cebebb7268054cc4a70461c9bce4a6a50bea4398f78955136deee4ef911d1a","source_hash":"8f3f31f62570081c2c461f1d5c8e62d3b39492607f7e0f2dafbb2259c08e609e","text":"  第 1 条和第 2 条中的“统一教育研究所”应改为“国立统一教育研究所”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00024","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011982-279321-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1911,"end":1994,"target_id":"75e4c5f7b645558d33ae1e4f228af0a49db61679d7c7714fce4bad35beb52c5e","source_hash":"9248b2e24de18084bf97ce590674bef82b9b575cb734a51d75b05e9b83a5b502","text":"  除第4条、第5条第1款和第2款、第6条、第7条和第8条第1款的子款外，第一部分中的“统一教育研究所所长”应改为“国立统一教育研究所所长”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00025","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011982-279321-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1994,"end":2034,"target_id":"759efb33a9fca1ce430965fd75703cc4db8e10bd22694d00143c36827abdd3e3","source_hash":"e97b404d0f442c71631e31731e502f55275b7125b31d7af03fdf334c90e45393","text":"增编（统一部及其下属机构组织结构）<2025年11月4日，第35838号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00026","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011982-279321-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2034,"end":2063,"target_id":"4987b09a9d800f198c91b99ce21496bad81b1f5bed440433809033aa3e3559b2","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00027","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011982-279321-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2063,"end":2071,"target_id":"b722985e0aef1859b34ad6bf04a48b266de31bc1fe444e0b8e07d01dbb101be8","source_hash":"1fa2d78222cc5f3a7b268ba3015a524a8e57a9355a8b17e0ae4253566ef34323","text":"第 2 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00028","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011982-279321-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2071,"end":2134,"target_id":"cae3d7b364caf569865aea96c4c7cb947fed2d013192d13034f90b04377a0430","source_hash":"cc674f92520f3d7399cba4b018236240f61516198b342200d30994029d2894aa","text":"第三条（修改其他法律）①和②已省略\n\n  ③ 《统一与朝鲜研究经费支付条例》部分修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00029","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011982-279321-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2134,"end":2183,"target_id":"9c2ff021f2c1d29ae3d44ce7cbbc684ac61f9979eb233105409e06ddba6ee5b3","source_hash":"df811408b9e31c27c526b8a6f2368fcd21e2848e46d47a52be6f1b59cc3f830a","text":"  第 1 条和第 2 条中的“国立统一教育研究所”应改为“国立和平统一民主教育研究所”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00030","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011982-279321-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2183,"end":2270,"target_id":"1578dc0110c5e562940c9303261ca768a83bd82034ed0e59c1908db181b20807","source_hash":"95a15192a96d2ad882460611dd66abe155f74b8be565bde32de9d635a7630f43","text":"  除第 4 条、第 5 条第 1 款和第 2 款、第 6 条、第 7 条和第 8 条第 1 款的子款外，第一部分中的“统一教育研究所所长”应改为“和平统一民主教育研究所所长”。"}]}